// Project structure verification.
// Each verify_* function tests one discrete structural invariant and returns
// a VerifyResult. The set of invariants grows with the pipeline phases.
//
// Consumed by main.lis (CLI) and the orchestration application.
// Invoke via `capp-build verify <subcommand>` for interactive use,
